. GitHub's automatic “Source code” archives represent the older repository checkout associated with the tag.\n\nValidation: full XeLaTeX/latexmk build; no missing references, citations or characters, overfull boxes or physical-page text overflow. All four current V2 schematic sheets and 31 PCB pages verified in the PDF. Source ZIP CRC and all member hashes verified.\n"}